EventScript_RouteTrainer_LASS_CRISSY_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Mushroom POKéMON hide well.\p"
    .string "The trick is watching where the\n"
    .string "mountain stays cool and damp.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE12_SWIMMER_DAWN_Text_Intro::
    .string "The bridge cuts the wind,\n"
    .string "but the water still pushes hard.\p"
    .string "I train where the current argues\n"
