EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_KINDRA_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on ROUTE 24?\n"
    .string "Then we battle again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_KINDRA_Text_Defeat::
    .string "ROUTE 24 wins today!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_KINDRA_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 24 has more to teach\n"
    .string "than one battle can show.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_LEAH_Text_Intro::
    .string "This SCOUT knows\n"
    .string "ROUTE 17 well!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_LEAH_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on ROUTE 17?\n"
    .string "Then we battle again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_LEAH_Text_Defeat::
    .string "ROUTE 17 wins today!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_LEAH_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 17 has more to teach\n"
    .string "than one battle can show.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_MARTHA_Text_Intro::
    .string "The road gets quiet before\n"
    .string "LAVENDER.\p"
    .string "That's when a SCOUT should pay\n"
    .string "the most attention.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_MARTHA_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You came back from LAVENDER?\p"
    .string "Then you know why I keep watch\n"
    .string "out here.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_MARTHA_Text_Defeat::
    .string "I blinked first!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_MARTHA_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "When a place feels still, people\n"
    .string "drop their guard.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 8 taught me not to.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_MISSY_Text_Intro::
    .string "This SCOUT knows\n"
    .string "ROUTE 13 well!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_MISSY_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on ROUTE 13?\n"
    .string "Then we battle again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_MISSY_Text_Defeat::
    .string "ROUTE 13 wins today!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_MISSY_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 13 has more to teach\n"
    .string "than one battle can show.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_SOFIA_Text_Intro::
    .string "The UNDERGROUND PATH makes this\n"
    .string "tiny route feel important.\p"
    .string "A good SCOUT checks every crossing!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_SOFIA_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You found your way back through\n"
    .string "the tunnel traffic.\p"
    .string "Let's see if your team kept pace!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_SOFIA_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You crossed my line cleanly!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_SOFIA_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Short routes can hide big choices.\p"
    .string "CELADON, SAFFRON, or the tunnel-\n"
    .string "you always have to pick a path.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE10_SWIMMER_SUSIE_Text_Intro::
    .string "South of here, LAVENDER\n"
    .string "gets so still.\p"
    .string "I swim hard to shake off\n"
    .string "that quiet!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE10_SWIMMER_SUSIE_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Need to shake off the quiet?\p"
    .string "A battle will do it!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE10_SWIMMER_SUSIE_Text_Defeat::
    .string "That woke me up!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE10_SWIMMER_SUSIE_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "It's strange.\p"
    .string "The water moves, but the road\n"
    .string "still feels calm near LAVENDER.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_VALERIE_Text_Intro::
    .string "This SCOUT knows\n"
    .string "ROUTE 25 well!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_VALERIE_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on ROUTE 25?\n"
    .string "Then we battle again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_VALERIE_Text_Defeat::
    .string "ROUTE 25 wins today!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PICNICKER_VALERIE_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 25 has more to teach\n"
    .string "than one battle can show.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_ALIZE_Text_Intro::
    .string "POKéMON raised near busy roads\n"
    .string "learn to stay calm.\p"
    .string "Mine trained beside SAFFRON's\n"
    .string "traffic!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_ALIZE_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "My POKéMON have heard every step\n"
    .string "on this road.\p"
    .string "They know yours too. Rematch?$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_ALIZE_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Your team stayed calmer!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_ALIZE_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "A good BREEDER watches where a\n"
    .string "POKéMON grows up.\p"
    .string "Road sounds can shape temperament.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_ALLISON_Text_Intro::
    .string "POKéMON raised near DIGLETT'S\n"
    .string "CAVE get used to sudden rumbling.\p"
    .string "Mine won't flinch easily!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_ALLISON_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "The ground rumbled twice today.\p"
    .string "My team took it calmly.\n"
    .string "Ready for a rematch?$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_ALLISON_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You kept steadier than us!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_ALLISON_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "A road can train temperament.\p"
    .string "Noise, wind, footsteps,\n"
    .string "tremors-it all matters.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_BETHANY_Text_Intro::
    .string "This BREEDER knows\n"
    .string "ROUTE 25 well!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_BETHANY_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on ROUTE 25?\n"
    .string "Then we battle again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_BETHANY_Text_Defeat::
    .string "ROUTE 25 wins today!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_BREEDER_BETHANY_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 25 has more to teach\n"
    .string "than one battle can show.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_RANGER_KATELYN_Text_Intro::
    .string "I watch ROUTE 5 because city\n"
    .string "travelers and wild POKéMON share\l"
    .string "the same narrow path.\p"
    .string "Show me you can pass through\n"
    .string "with care!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_RANGER_KATELYN_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You returned without trampling\n"
    .string "the grass.\p"
    .string "Good. Now let's see your battle\n"
    .string "discipline!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_RANGER_KATELYN_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Careful and strong. Good.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_RANGER_KATELYN_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The DAY CARE, the tunnel, the\n"
    .string "city gate...\p"
    .string "Busy places need gentle footsteps.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_RANGER_LOGAN_Text_Intro::
    .string "ROUTE 11 links city traffic\n"
    .string "to wild cave habitat.\p"
    .string "I make sure travelers respect\n"
    .string "both sides.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_RANGER_LOGAN_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You crossed without disturbing\n"
    .string "the grass or cave mouth.\p"
    .string "That earns a rematch.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_RANGER_LOGAN_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Good control. Well done.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_PKMN_RANGER_LOGAN_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The safest routes are the ones\n"
    .string "where people notice the wild\l"
    .string "places beside them.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_ALEXIS_Text_Intro::
    .string "I came down from PALLET to play\n"
    .string "where the water starts getting\l"
    .string "deep.\p"
    .string "I'm not scared of ROUTE 21!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_ALEXIS_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back where PALLET's beach turns\n"
    .string "into a real sea route?\p"
    .string "Then I want another battle!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_ALEXIS_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Splashed out!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_ALEXIS_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The grown-ups swim farther south,\n"
    .string "but I like staying near PALLET.\p"
    .string "This part of ROUTE 21 is big\n"
    .string "enough for me.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_AMIRA_Text_Intro::
    .string "The grown-ups swim far out,\n"
    .string "but I like the SEAFOAM shore.\p"
    .string "It's still my battle spot!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_AMIRA_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back near SEAFOAM?\p"
    .string "Then my shore training gets\n"
    .string "another test!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_AMIRA_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Splashed again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_AMIRA_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The water is colder here than\n"
    .string "near FUCHSIA.\p"
    .string "I can feel SEAFOAM breathing\n"
    .string "under the waves.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_NOAH_Text_Intro::
    .string "I counted the ferry waves!\p"
    .string "If I can time them, I can time\n"
    .string "a battle too!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_NOAH_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "The ferry made more waves!\p"
    .string "Let's battle before they settle.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_NOAH_Text_Defeat::
    .string "My timing slipped!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_NOAH_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Big swimmers go all the way to\n"
    .string "CINNABAR.\p"
    .string "I'm practising one wave at a\n"
    .string "time.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_CHAD_Text_Intro::
    .string "I train here because CELADON's\n"
    .string "right there and SAFFRON's right\l"
    .string "there too!\p"
    .string "Two cities means twice the battles!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_CHAD_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You came back from one city or\n"
    .string "the other, right?\p"
    .string "Then show me what you learned!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_CHAD_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Whoa, that's city-level strong!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_CHAD_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "I want to battle TRAINERS from\n"
    .string "both cities.\p"
    .string "That way I'll get strong twice\n"
    .string "as fast!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_CORDELL_Text_Intro::
    .string "The FUCHSIA gate is close, but\n"
    .string "the road still has rough patches.\p"
    .string "A SCOUT checks them all!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_CORDELL_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back near FUCHSIA?\p"
    .string "Then show me you remember the\n"
    .string "rough patches!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_CORDELL_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You checked the road better!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_CORDELL_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "A route can change right at the\n"
    .string "edge of a city.\p"
    .string "That's why a SCOUT keeps watching\n"
    .string "until the very last step.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_DAN_Text_Intro::
    .string "I can see VERMILION from here,\n"
    .string "but I don't want to wait for\l"
    .string "the beach.\p"
    .string "Let's battle right here!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_DAN_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Still between SAFFRON and the\n"
    .string "harbour?\p"
    .string "Good! I need another practice\n"
    .string "battle before swimming.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_DAN_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Splashdown!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_TUBER_DAN_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "This route is like a countdown.\p"
    .string "Every step south gets you closer\n"
    .string "to VERMILION's water.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE12_TUBER_DAVE_Text_Intro::
    .string "Everyone calls this the fishing\n"
    .string "route, but I found a splash lane!\p"
    .string "Race me before the anglers notice!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE12_TUBER_DAVE_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back to my splash lane?\p"
    .string "Then we race-battle again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE12_TUBER_DAVE_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You splashed ahead!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE12_TUBER_DAVE_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The best part of ROUTE 12 is\n"
    .string "how long it stays by the water.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_DESTIN_Text_Intro::
    .string "This YOUNGSTER knows\n"
    .string "ROUTE 14 well!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_DESTIN_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on ROUTE 14?\n"
    .string "Then we battle again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_DESTIN_Text_Defeat::
    .string "ROUTE 14 wins today!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_DESTIN_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 14 has more to teach\n"
    .string "than one battle can show.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE10_TUBER_DILLON_Text_Intro::
    .string "I can see the bridge to\n"
    .string "ROUTE 25 from up here!\p"
    .string "Race me before the shore bends!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE10_TUBER_DILLON_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back near the bridge path?\p"
    .string "Then it's race time again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE10_TUBER_DILLON_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You took the bend faster!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE10_TUBER_DILLON_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 10 feels like a shortcut,\n"
    .string "but it twists more than you think.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_EDDIE_Text_Intro::
    .string "These rocks are younger than the\n"
    .string "ones in ROCK TUNNEL.\p"
    .string "Still, they have stories.\n"
    .string "Battle me and I'll tell you!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_EDDIE_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back to study the ridge?\p"
    .string "Good. A rematch is the best field\n"
    .string "note.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_EDDIE_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Your team made better history!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_EDDIE_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The surface stones here hint at\n"
    .string "the tunnel ahead.\p"
    .string "That's why RUIN MANIACS never\n"
    .string "walk a road casually.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_HIKER_ALAN_Text_Intro::
    .string "The rocks here are smaller than\n"
    .string "mountain stone, but just as mean.\p"
    .string "Watch your footing!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_HIKER_ALAN_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back over the broken ground?\p"
    .string "Then let's see if your stance\n"
    .string "has improved!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_HIKER_ALAN_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You stayed steady!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_HIKER_ALAN_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "A HIKER can learn plenty here.\p"
    .string "The bridge is flat, but this road\n"
    .string "makes every step count.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_BIKER_KOJI_Text_Intro::
    .string "This track is all ruts and grit.\p"
    .string "That's perfect for a BIKER who\n"
    .string "wants better control!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_BIKER_KOJI_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I took the rough line twice today.\p"
    .string "My tires and my team are ready!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_BIKER_KOJI_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Skidded out!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_BIKER_KOJI_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Smooth roads make lazy riders.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 13 keeps me honest.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_SCOUT_JOHNSON_Text_Intro::
    .string "A SCOUT checks the safest line\n"
    .string "through rough country.\p"
    .string "Battle me before you choose yours!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_SCOUT_JOHNSON_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You found your way back through\n"
    .string "the rough grass.\p"
    .string "Good. Now prove you learned it!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_SCOUT_JOHNSON_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You picked the better line!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_SCOUT_JOHNSON_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "North is SILENCE BRIDGE.\p"
    .string "South, the road gets rough again.\n"
    .string "A good SCOUT marks both.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_TRIATHLETE_MISSY_Text_Intro::
    .string "I pace myself between bridge\n"
    .string "planks and broken ground.\p"
    .string "Can your POKéMON keep rhythm?$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_TRIATHLETE_MISSY_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I tightened my pace on the bend.\p"
    .string "Let's see if your team can match\n"
    .string "it again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_TRIATHLETE_MISSY_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You had the stronger finish!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE13_TRIATHLETE_MISSY_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Endurance is about adapting.\p"
    .string "On ROUTE 13, the ground changes\n"
    .string "before your breathing does.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_TRIATHLETE_LOLA_Text_Intro::
    .string "This road keeps changing underfoot.\p"
    .string "That's the best way to train a\n"
    .string "steady stride!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_TRIATHLETE_LOLA_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back for another uneven run?\p"
    .string "Good. My rhythm is sharper now!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_TRIATHLETE_LOLA_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You kept your balance!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_TRIATHLETE_LOLA_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 14 is tougher than it looks.\p"
    .string "If your feet drift, your commands\n"
    .string "drift with them.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_SCOUT_DESTIN_Text_Intro::
    .string "A SCOUT marks where the grass\n"
    .string "breaks and where the path bends.\p"
    .string "Battle me before you pass!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_SCOUT_DESTIN_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You found my marker again.\p"
    .string "That deserves another battle!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_SCOUT_DESTIN_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You read the path better!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_SCOUT_DESTIN_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "This road funnels travelers toward\n"
    .string "FUCHSIA.\p"
    .string "A good SCOUT watches who arrives\n"
    .string "tired and who arrives ready.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_HIKER_BRICE_Text_Intro::
    .string "A HIKER doesn't need a mountain\n"
    .string "to test his boots.\p"
    .string "This rough road will do!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_HIKER_BRICE_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "My boots know this road now.\p"
    .string "Let's see if your POKéMON know it\n"
    .string "as well!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_HIKER_BRICE_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You stepped cleaner!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_HIKER_BRICE_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 14 is good training.\p"
    .string "The stones are low, but they still\n"
    .string "make you pay attention.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_TRIATHLETE_IRENE_Text_Intro::
    .string "I use the long straightaways for\n"
    .string "speed and the rough patches for\l"
    .string "control.\p"
    .string "Now I need battle practice!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_TRIATHLETE_IRENE_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I ran the straightaway twice today.\p"
    .string "Let's see if that extra pace shows!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_TRIATHLETE_IRENE_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You had the better kick!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE14_TRIATHLETE_IRENE_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 14 is a good endurance road.\p"
    .string "It never lets you settle into one\n"
    .string "easy rhythm.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_SCOUT_CORDELL_Text_Intro::
    .string "The gate to FUCHSIA is close,\n"
    .string "but the rough grass still matters.\p"
    .string "A SCOUT checks the last stretch!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_SCOUT_CORDELL_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on the last stretch?\p"
    .string "Then show me you remember the\n"
    .string "safe line!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_SCOUT_CORDELL_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You found it!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_SCOUT_CORDELL_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "People relax when a city is close.\p"
    .string "That's when they miss loose stones,\n"
    .string "bent grass, and hidden turns.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_HIKER_CLARK_Text_Intro::
    .string "A road doesn't need a mountain\n"
    .string "to work your legs.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 15 has enough rough ground\n"
    .string "for me!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_HIKER_CLARK_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I've walked this road again.\p"
    .string "My boots and my POKéMON are\n"
    .string "settled in now!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_HIKER_CLARK_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You outpaced me!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_HIKER_CLARK_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "A HIKER notices where the land\n"
    .string "changes.\p"
    .string "Near FUCHSIA, the road starts to\n"
    .string "feel softer but no less tricky.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_HIKER_TRENT_Text_Intro::
    .string "The stones here sit low, but they\n"
    .string "still twist an ankle.\p"
    .string "Step carefully, then battle hard!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_HIKER_TRENT_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You came back over the low stones.\p"
    .string "Good. Let's see if your team\n"
    .string "kept its footing!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_HIKER_TRENT_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Solid footing!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_HIKER_TRENT_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 15 is a reminder that rough\n"
    .string "terrain isn't always tall terrain.\p"
    .string "Sometimes it's right underfoot.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIKER_LUKAS_Text_Intro::
    .string "This road gets tight near FUCHSIA.\p"
    .string "A BIKER has to make every turn\n"
    .string "count!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIKER_LUKAS_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I tightened my turns since last\n"
    .string "time.\p"
    .string "Let's see if you can keep up!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIKER_LUKAS_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You took the inside line!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIKER_LUKAS_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 15 teaches control.\p"
    .string "Too much speed and you're in the\n"
    .string "grass before you know it.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIRD_KEEPER_MITCH_Text_Intro::
    .string "My bird POKéMON watch travelers\n"
    .string "arrive from FUCHSIA.\p"
    .string "They picked you out!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIRD_KEEPER_MITCH_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "My birds picked you out again.\p"
    .string "They know a strong TRAINER when\n"
    .string "they see one!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIRD_KEEPER_MITCH_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Sharp eyes weren't enough!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIRD_KEEPER_MITCH_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Bird POKéMON like this route.\p"
    .string "The forest edge gives cover, and\n"
    .string "the road gives them sightlines.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIRD_KEEPER_MARLON_Text_Intro::
    .string "The sky opens just enough here\n"
    .string "for my birds to stretch out.\p"
    .string "Let's battle under it!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIRD_KEEPER_MARLON_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "The sky's clear again.\p"
    .string "My birds want another go!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIRD_KEEPER_MARLON_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You ruled the sky!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE15_BIRD_KEEPER_MARLON_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The trees make the air twist.\p"
    .string "A good bird keeper teaches quick\n"
    .string "turns before high climbs.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_CAMPER_JOHNSON_Text_Intro::
    .string "This SCOUT knows\n"
    .string "ROUTE 13 well!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_CAMPER_JOHNSON_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on ROUTE 13?\n"
    .string "Then we battle again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_CAMPER_JOHNSON_Text_Defeat::
    .string "ROUTE 13 wins today!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_CAMPER_JOHNSON_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 13 has more to teach\n"
    .string "than one battle can show.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_JOSH_Text_Intro::
    .string "MT. MOON is ahead, so I'm training\n"
    .string "on every rocky patch I can find!\p"
    .string "Battle me!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_JOSH_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I trained on the rocks again!\p"
    .string "This time, I won't lose my footing!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_JOSH_Text_Defeat::
    .string "I slipped up!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_JOSH_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The closer you get to MT. MOON,\n"
    .string "the tougher the road feels.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_TIMMY_Text_Intro::
    .string "I tripped on a GEODUDE earlier,\n"
    .string "but I'm not going home!\p"
    .string "ROUTE 4 made me tougher!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_TIMMY_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I watched my step this time!\p"
    .string "Now watch out for my POKéMON!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_TIMMY_Text_Defeat::
    .string "I still stumbled!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_TIMMY_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The rocks here are rough, but they\n"
    .string "make you pay attention.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_TYLER_Text_Intro::
    .string "I'm racing everyone from SAFFRON\n"
    .string "to LAVENDER!\p"
    .string "If you want past me, battle first!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_TYLER_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You came back around?\p"
    .string "Great! I need a rematch before\n"
    .string "my next sprint.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_TYLER_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You passed me!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_YOUNGSTER_TYLER_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "This route is long enough for a\n"
    .string "race and narrow enough for a\n"
    .string "battle.$"
Route17_EventScript_Erin_Text_Intro::
    .string "I picked a rest spot near the\n"
    .string "bottom of CYCLING ROAD.\p"
    .string "If you still have energy, battle\n"
    .string "me before ROUTE 18!$"
Route17_EventScript_Erin_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back near the end of the slope?\p"
    .string "Good. Let's see if you saved\n"
    .string "enough energy for me!$"
Route17_EventScript_Erin_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You saved plenty!$"
Route17_EventScript_Erin_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "By this point, everyone starts\n"
    .string "thinking about FUCHSIA.\p"
    .string "I like making them pause one\n"
    .string "last time.$"
Route17_EventScript_June_Text_Intro::
    .string "I brought picnic food, but the\n"
    .string "wind keeps trying to steal it.\p"
    .string "A battle is easier to hold onto!$"
Route17_EventScript_June_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on the windy stretch?\p"
    .string "Good. My lunch can wait for\n"
    .string "one more battle!$"
Route17_EventScript_June_Text_Defeat::
    .string "There goes my rhythm!$"
Route17_EventScript_June_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The grass beside the road is\n"
    .string "calmer than the pavement.\p"
    .string "That's why I stay near the edge.$"
Route17_EventScript_Miles_Text_Intro::
    .string "I mark the middle stretch by\n"
    .string "how loud the wheels get.\p"
    .string "You're right on time for battle!$"
Route17_EventScript_Miles_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Heard your wheels coming.\p"
    .string "Let's make the middle stretch\n"
    .string "loud again!$"
Route17_EventScript_Miles_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You drowned out my wheels!$"
Route17_EventScript_Miles_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Halfway down, riders either\n"
    .string "settle in or lose focus.\p"
    .string "I battle the ones who still\n"
    .string "look sharp.$"
Route17_EventScript_Milo_Text_Intro::
    .string "I race beside the BIKERS until\n"
    .string "my legs give out.\p"
    .string "If you want past me, battle first!$"
Route17_EventScript_Milo_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back for another downhill race?\p"
    .string "Great! I'll battle before my\n"
    .string "next sprint.$"
Route17_EventScript_Milo_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You passed me!$"
Route17_EventScript_Milo_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "This route is long enough for a\n"
    .string "race and narrow enough for a\n"
    .string "battle.$"
Route17_EventScript_Mina_Text_Intro::
    .string "Near the bottom, everyone thinks\n"
    .string "the hard part is over.\p"
    .string "That's when I battle them!$"
Route17_EventScript_Mina_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You came back to the lower road?\p"
    .string "Then don't relax yet. Battle me!$"
Route17_EventScript_Mina_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You didn't relax!$"
Route17_EventScript_Mina_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "FUCHSIA feels close from here,\n"
    .string "but ROUTE 17 still has teeth.$"
Route17_EventScript_Orson_Text_Intro::
    .string "The lower slope gets faster\n"
    .string "than people expect.\p"
    .string "If you can stop for battle,\n"
    .string "you're doing fine.$"
Route17_EventScript_Orson_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Managed to stop on the lower\n"
    .string "slope again?\p"
    .string "Then you can stop for a rematch.$"
Route17_EventScript_Orson_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Solid braking!$"
Route17_EventScript_Orson_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Anyone can roll downhill.\p"
    .string "A good rider chooses exactly\n"
    .string "where to stop.$"
Route17_EventScript_Tess_Text_Intro::
    .string "I count BIKERS as they pass.\p"
    .string "You're trainer number too many\n"
    .string "to ignore!$"
Route17_EventScript_Tess_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I counted you coming back.\p"
    .string "That means I get another battle!$"
Route17_EventScript_Tess_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Lost count!$"
Route17_EventScript_Tess_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The best part of CYCLING ROAD\n"
    .string "is watching everyone find their\n"
    .string "own pace.$"
Route17_EventScript_Vaughn_Text_Intro::
    .string "The road gets narrow here.\p"
    .string "That means we settle things\n"
    .string "quick and clean.$"
Route17_EventScript_Vaughn_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back in my lane?\p"
    .string "Then we settle it quick and\n"
    .string "clean again.$"
Route17_EventScript_Vaughn_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Clean enough!$"
Route17_EventScript_Vaughn_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "A long road needs clear lanes.\p"
    .string "Without them, everyone eats dust.$"
Route17_EventScript_Wade_Text_Intro::
    .string "I guard this bend because people\n"
    .string "take it too fast.\p"
    .string "Battle me, then brake harder!$"
Route17_EventScript_Wade_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back at the bend?\p"
    .string "Good. Brake, battle, then roll.$"
Route17_EventScript_Wade_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You took the bend!$"
Route17_EventScript_Wade_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The bend teaches patience.\p"
    .string "Rush it and the road chooses\n"
    .string "your line for you.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_LASS_KAY_Text_Intro::
    .string "I came out from CELADON to watch\n"
    .string "the bikes fly past.\p"
    .string "Watching made me want a battle!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_LASS_KAY_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on the fast road?\p"
    .string "Good. I was hoping to see your\n"
    .string "team fly past again!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_LASS_KAY_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You flew past me!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_LASS_KAY_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "CYCLING ROAD looks intimidating,\n"
    .string "but everyone finds a pace.\p"
    .string "Even watching has a rhythm.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_SCOUT_LEAH_Text_Intro::
    .string "A SCOUT marks safe places to\n"
    .string "pause on a long route.\p"
    .string "This one has room for a battle!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_SCOUT_LEAH_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back at my marked rest point?\p"
    .string "Then you're rested enough for\n"
    .string "another battle!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_SCOUT_LEAH_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You made good use of the stop!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_SCOUT_LEAH_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 17 is long, but it is not\n"
    .string "empty.\p"
    .string "Good rest points turn a hard road\n"
    .string "into a manageable one.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_TRIATHLETE_DAX_Text_Intro::
    .string "This slope is my training route.\p"
    .string "Keep up if you can!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_TRIATHLETE_DAX_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back for another downhill run?\p"
    .string "Good. Keep your cadence steady!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_TRIATHLETE_DAX_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You kept pace!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_TRIATHLETE_DAX_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "A TRIATHLETE learns fast legs are\n"
    .string "useless without calm hands.$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_TRIATHLETE_NINA_Text_Intro::
    .string "I time every lap from CELADON\n"
    .string "to FUCHSIA.\p"
    .string "Let's see your split!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_TRIATHLETE_NINA_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Another timed run?\p"
    .string "Then don't blink!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_TRIATHLETE_NINA_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Fast finish!$"
EventScript_RouteTrainer_ROUTE17_TRIATHLETE_NINA_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The road changes under your\n"
    .string "wheels.\p"
    .string "That's what makes it training.$"
Route25_EventScript_Franklin_Text_Intro::
    .string "This BREEDER knows\n"
    .string "ROUTE 25 well!$"
Route25_EventScript_Franklin_Text_RematchIntro::
