WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10FishermanPierce_Text_Intro::
    .string "The POWER PLANT hums through\n"
    .string "the water if you listen.\p"
    .string "The fish notice it before we do!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10FishermanPierce_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Hear that hum again?\p"
    .string "Then the fish are moving,\n"
    .string "and so are we!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10FishermanPierce_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You felt the line twitch!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10FishermanPierce_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Some days the current changes\n"
    .string "right when the plant surges.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10SailorArlen_Text_Intro::
    .string "A sailor can learn plenty\n"
    .string "away from the sea.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 10's narrow waterway\n"
    .string "teaches control!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10SailorArlen_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back in this narrow channel?\p"
    .string "Good. Tight water, tight battle!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10SailorArlen_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You held the channel!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10SailorArlen_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "VERMILION has open harbor air.\p"
    .string "Here, the cliffs squeeze every\n"
    .string "gust into a command.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10SwimmerNola_Text_Intro::
    .string "I time my laps between the\n"
    .string "POWER PLANT and ROCK TUNNEL.\p"
    .string "One buzzes, one echoes!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10SwimmerNola_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I heard the echo and the hum.\p"
    .string "That means it's rematch time!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10SwimmerNola_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You beat my timing!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10SwimmerNola_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "It's a good route for training.\p"
    .string "The water never lets you keep\n"
    .string "one rhythm for long.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10TuberMika_Text_Intro::
    .string "The bridge up north makes\n"
    .string "this place feel secret.\p"
    .string "Like a beach hiding under\n"
    .string "all the cliffs!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10TuberMika_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You found the hidden beach\n"
    .string "feeling again!\p"
    .string "Let's battle!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10TuberMika_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You splashed right past me!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route10TuberMika_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "If you follow the water north,\n"
    .string "it feels like CERULEAN is\l"
    .string "just around the bend.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12FishermanEbb_Text_Intro::
    .string "I fish where LAVENDER's quiet\n"
    .string "settles onto the water.\p"
    .string "Even the splashes sound softer.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12FishermanEbb_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back to the quiet water?\p"
    .string "Keep your voice low and battle!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12FishermanEbb_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Soft water, hard loss.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12FishermanEbb_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Some FISHERMEN like chatter.\p"
    .string "I like listening for the float\n"
    .string "to dip.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12FishermanReed_Text_Intro::
    .string "Down here, the bridge shadows\n"
    .string "make perfect hiding spots.\p"
    .string "For fish and for battles!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12FishermanReed_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back under the bridge shadows?\p"
    .string "Let's see what bites first.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12FishermanReed_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You pulled me from cover!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12FishermanReed_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The longer the bridge,\n"
    .string "the more shadows underneath.\p"
    .string "That means more places to cast.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SailorBriggs_Text_Intro::
    .string "A sailor can read open water.\p"
    .string "ROUTE 12 teaches the opposite:\n"
    .string "tight water, tight turns!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SailorBriggs_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back in the narrow channel?\p"
    .string "Good. Hold your course!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SailorBriggs_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You held the channel!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SailorBriggs_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "VERMILION HARBOR feels wide\n"
    .string "after you train here awhile.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SwimmerCora_Text_Intro::
    .string "The anglers watch the surface.\p"
    .string "I train below it, where the\n"
    .string "current really moves.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SwimmerCora_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back to test the current?\p"
    .string "Dive into this rematch!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SwimmerCora_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You read the current!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SwimmerCora_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Don't judge this route from the\n"
    .string "bridge alone.\p"
    .string "The water has its own road.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SwimmerMaris_Text_Intro::
    .string "I swim laps between the bridge\n"
    .string "posts.\p"
    .string "Miss one turn and the current\n"
    .string "laughs at you!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SwimmerMaris_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back between the posts?\p"
    .string "Then keep your turns sharp!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SwimmerMaris_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Clean turn!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12SwimmerMaris_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "The bridge makes a perfect lane\n"
    .string "if you know how to use it.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TriathleteVera_Text_Intro::
    .string "Route training means adapting:\n"
    .string "bridge, water, bridge again.\p"
    .string "Show me your pace!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TriathleteVera_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back for another long-route\n"
    .string "pace test?$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TriathleteVera_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You kept the pace!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TriathleteVera_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 12 is endurance training\n"
    .string "disguised as a shortcut south.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TuberLuca_Text_Intro::
    .string "The grown-ups fish all day,\n"
    .string "but I say the bridge is for\l"
    .string "splashing too!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TuberLuca_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back to splash by the bridge?\p"
    .string "Then let's battle!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TuberLuca_Text_Defeat::
    .string "Splashdown!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TuberLuca_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "If you stand still too long here,\n"
    .string "someone starts fishing beside you.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TuberPia_Text_Intro::
    .string "I counted every bridge post\n"
    .string "from LAVENDER down here.\p"
    .string "Then I got bored and battled!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TuberPia_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "I lost count again.\p"
    .string "A rematch sounds more fun!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TuberPia_Text_Defeat::
    .string "I counted that as a loss!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route12TuberPia_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 12 is so long that even\n"
    .string "counting bridge posts feels like\l"
    .string "a journey.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route24SwimmerNell_Text_Intro::
    .string "This SWIMMER knows\n"
    .string "ROUTE 24 well!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route24SwimmerNell_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back on ROUTE 24?\n"
    .string "Then we battle again!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route24SwimmerNell_Text_Defeat::
    .string "ROUTE 24 wins today!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route24SwimmerNell_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "ROUTE 24 has more to teach\n"
    .string "than one battle can show.$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route6FishermanSeth_Text_Intro::
    .string "SAFFRON's close enough to hear\n"
    .string "the city noise, but the water\l"
    .string "keeps me calm.\p"
    .string "Let's see if it calms you too!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route6FishermanSeth_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "Back to the little water road?\p"
    .string "Cast your line. I'll cast mine!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route6FishermanSeth_Text_Defeat::
    .string "You reeled that in neatly!$"
WatersEdge_EventScript_Route6FishermanSeth_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Most people use ROUTE 6 as a\n"
    .string "shortcut.\p"
    .string "FISHERMEN know shortcuts still\n"
    .string "have places worth stopping.$"
@ End location-specific habitat trainer text


